|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| CommunityWorkshops | 6/6 | 6/6 | 6/6 | 70% | 100% | 70% | 100% | 51% / 54% | $4.51 |
| Inventory | 6/6 | 6/6 | 6/6 | 93% | 100% | 93% | 93% | 71% / 51% | $4.11 |

